==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to have full [[Legendary Cat Shield]] and [[Legendary Cat Sword]] on all three chapters before trying this level. If you do, spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] the entire level for an almost guaranteed victory.

If you don't, this stage will be harder. Use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] as well as 2 meatshields. Spam all three of those, and if the Le'boin breaks through your front line, fire the Cat Cannon. If you have any other long ranged cats that outrange the Le'boin they should help massively.

